{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861120/extras/3f1b744a2d4389fa2b62b474604d693e.avif?t=1752191171\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Hangtime!</i> is a volleyball roguelike about instinct, timing, and high-stakes momentum.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every rally is fast and tense\u2014spikes, blocks, and midair reads with everything on the line. One loss ends your bracket. One win makes it all worth it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861120/extras/efe464509a4e4e968878a99eff08a976.poster.avif?t=1752191171\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861120/extras/efe464509a4e4e968878a99eff08a976.webm?t=1752191171\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861120/extras/efe464509a4e4e968878a99eff08a976.mp4?t=1752191171\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861120/extras/65a6f5c05aa3d758714c356dd1062087.avif?t=1752191171\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Techniques aren\u2019t just stat boosts\u2014they change how you play. The more you stack, the weirder and more powerful your style becomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A few favorites:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Deadball Set</strong> \u2013 slows the set at its highest point, letting you reposition last second.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hook Tip</strong> \u2013 fast, sharp drop that dodges blockers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Pipe</strong> \u2013 leap from the back row for huge surprise spikes</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861120/extras/b9503152da276d372f3877f2d6de98a6.poster.avif?t=1752191171\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861120/extras/b9503152da276d372f3877f2d6de98a6.webm?t=1752191171\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861120/extras/b9503152da276d372f3877f2d6de98a6.mp4?t=1752191171\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861120/extras/c28b8479e37bc264673edad15d935dc3.avif?t=1752191171\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No two teams play the same\u2014and every one of them is scary in their own way.<br>Some hit hard. Some never miss. Some twist the tempo until you lose the beat.<br>And when the stakes get high, the real monsters show up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You\u2019ll hear names like <strong>Tenzio</strong> whispered in the locker room\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">and at the top? A giant awaits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861120/extras/cea9269a169bff158d16f7822530428f.poster.avif?t=1752191171\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861120/extras/cea9269a169bff158d16f7822530428f.webm?t=1752191171\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861120/extras/cea9269a169bff158d16f7822530428f.mp4?t=1752191171\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861120/extras/34d7bd8e2e1c1c037242f305a3656d7b.avif?t=1752191171\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There\u2019s nothing like it.<br>You read the set. You jump early. You hang just long enough.<br>Then\u2014boom. You spike through the block. The match flips.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Hangtime!</i> is built for that moment.<br>Sharp controls, tight movement, and a touch of chaos give every rally a rhythm you can feel in your fingers. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><u><strong>Hangtime! is launching Oct 2025 \u2014 wishlist now and don\u2019t miss your shot.</strong></u></h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3861120?t=1752191171","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861120/f1f53983196c717a2d3116396579d5b742cff84d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1752191171","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861120/00306f0409434a1257da860214e8382ba752703f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752191171","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861120/00306f0409434a1257da860214e8382ba752703f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752191171","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861120/extras/3f1b744a2d4389fa2b62b474604d693e.avif?t=1752191171\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Hangtime!</i> is a volleyball roguelike about instinct, timing, and high-stakes momentum.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every rally is fa